  "title": "Nomadar Welcomes 58 Young U.S. Soccer Players to Cádiz for Elite Training with Cádiz CF",
  "summary": "This week, Cádiz becomes the meeting point between U.S. youth soccer and the Spanish professional model. Nomadar Corp., in collaboration with Cádiz CF, has welcomed a 69-person delegation from the United States, including 58 young soccer players born in 2012, 2013 and 2014, selected directly by WIMS Select to take part in a high-level training […]",
